      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ulame makasa ebe hawabuela mu nsubu wa Nzambi; kusemena ha buihi bua kunvua kudi kuhita milambu ya bahote buakane, bualu bua bobo kabena bamanye ne, Tudi tuenza bualu bubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mei kâluhuki mukana muebe lukasa; mutshima webe kauhatudi bualu ku mpala kua Nzambi lubilu; bualu bua Nzambi udi mu diulu, wewe udi ha buloba; nunku mei ebe ikale makehele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tshilota tshidi tshilua ne malu a bungi; diakula dia muhote didi dihatula mei a bungi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hawaditshiha kudi Nzambi, kujanguluki bua kumana mulayi; bualu bua yeye kena ne bahote disanka; ufute tshiwakalaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kubenga mua kuditshiha kudi kuhita kudinga buakane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuitabushi bua mukana muebe kukulenduisha; kuambidi messager ne, Nakadi mutuhakane; udi musue Nzambi ikale ne tshiji bua mei ebe, ashihe mudimu wa bianza biebe bua tshinyi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua mu bilota bia bungi mudi mei a bungi ahatuka, kadi utshine Nzambi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biwatangila bahele bakengeshibue ne kunyanga kua bilumbuluidi ne kushiha kua mikenji mu province wenu, kukemi bua malu au; bualu bua banfumu bonso badi ne banga badi babatangila, ne udi mubatambe bonso udi ha mutu habo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dikuatshisha dia buloba didi kudi bantu bonso; mukelenge muine udi ukuatshishibua ne bintu bia mu madimi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wananga biuma kena usankishibua ku biuma; wananga bubanji kena ukuta bubanji; ebu mbualu bua hatuhu kabidi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua hakumbana bintu, badi babidia badi bakumbana kahidi; ne nfumuʼabi udi ne difutu kai dikuabo, anu bua kuntangila ku mesu?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tulu tua muena mudimu tudi tuimpe biadieye bintu bikese anyi bia bungi; kadi kukuta kua muntu mubanji kakuena kumuladika tulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakatangila bualu bubi muinshi mua diba bua muntu mudilamine luhetu tô ne hakamukengeshalu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "luhetu elu ludi lujimina mu malu mabi; kadi bialeleye muana wa balume, kena ne tshia kumushila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bu muakahatukeye munda mua mamu wandi butaka, yeye neahingane kabidi; kena uya ne tshintu tshimue mu bianza biandi tshia mu midimu yonso yakenzeye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebu mbualu bubi kabidi bua muntu udi uhingana anu bu muakalueye. Udi ne difutu kai? Wakenzela luhehele mudimu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "matuku andi onso akadi mu midima, mu kanyinganyinga, ntatu, masama ne mu tshiji tshikole.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Monai, bualu bundi mmona buimpe ne bukumbanyine muntu: adie biandi, anue biandi ne asanke mu midimu yandi yonso idiye wenza muinshi mua diba, matuku onso a muoyo wandi adi Nzambi mumuhe; edi ndifutu diandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu yonso udi Nzambi muhe bintu ne bubanji ne bukole bua kubidia, bua kuangateye difutu diandi ne kusankeye mu midimu yandi amanye ne, Edi ndiha dia Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye kena mua kutamba kuvuluka matuku a muoyo wandi; bualu bua Nzambi udi umuvuishisha disanka mu mutshima wandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
